p.me:
\begin{array}{ll}
1. \amp f(a)\text{ is defined},\\
2. \amp \displaystyle \lim_{x\to a}f(x)\text{ exists},\\
3. \amp \displaystyle \lim_{x\to a}f(x)=f(a).
\end{array}

